{"seconds": 42.5, "exit": 0, "final": "Good! After Qxf7+ Rxf7 Rxf7, White has won the rook for a pawn and the position is completely winning. But the key line is Qxf7+ Kh8 Qxf8# - that's mate in 2! This is the winning move.\n\n**Best move:** Qxf7+\n\n**Main line:** Qxf7+ Kh8 Qxf8#\n\n**Motif:** pin (the f7 pawn is pinned to the king)\n\n**Coaching note:** The f7 pawn is pinned by your queen to Black's king\u2014it can't move or be defended. Capture it with check, and if the king moves to h8, play Qxf8 checkmate. If Black recaptures with the rook, you play Rxf7 and win material with a completely dominant position. Always scan for pinned pieces\u2014they're often the target of the most forcing moves.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Qxf7+\", \"line\": [\"Qxf7+\", \"Kh8\", \"Qxf8#\"], \"motifs\": [\"pin\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/3b1p2/pq1r4/1p1Q4/3P3P/1PP2R2/P5P1/2R3K1 w - - 1 29"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/3b1p2/pq1r4/1p1Q4/3P3P/1PP2R2/P5P1/2R3K1 w - - 1 29"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/3b1p2/pq1r4/1p1Q4/3P3P/1CP2R2/P5P1/2R3K1 w - - 1 29", "square": "d5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/3b1p2/pq1r4/1p1Q4/3P3P/1CP2R2/P5P1/2R3K1 w - - 1 29", "square": "f3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/3b1p2/pq1r4/1p1Q4/3P3P/1CP2R2/P5P1/2R3K1 w - - 1 29", "square": "c1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/3b1p2/pq1r4/1p1Q4/3P3P/1CP2R2/P5P1/2R3K1 w - - 1 29", "square": "d6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/3b1p2/pq1r4/1p1Q4/3P3P/1CP2R2/P5P1/2R3K1 w - - 1 29", "square": "b6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/3b1p2/pq1r4/1p1Q4/3P3P/1CP2R2/P5P1/2R3K1 w - - 1 29", "square": "f8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/3b1p2/pq1r4/1p1Q4/3P3P/1CP2R2/P5P1/2R3K1 w - - 1 29", "square": "d7"}}, {"tool": "ch